/**
 * InlineNativeCheckout — Unified delivery + payment flow
 * 
 * Renders inline inside OrderPopup (replacing the Shopify CTA).
 * Design matches OrderPopup's card-based aesthetic:
 *   - White card blocks with consistent padding and border-radius
 *   - Compact form fields (less border-radius, smaller, form-like)
 *   - Delivery + Payment merged into single flow (no separate steps)
 *   - Express Checkout (Apple Pay, Google Pay) prominent after address
 *   - Stripe Payment Element inline (no separate payment logos)
 *   - Shipping protection as full card (consistent with Shopify mode)
 *
 * UX improvements:
 *   - Google Places address autocomplete on address line 1
 *   - Browser autofill via proper autocomplete attributes + form wrapping
 *   - Edit/Save flow for address (no payment collapse)
 *   - Stripe locale forced to "en" to match page language
 *   - Express Checkout shown prominently after address entry
 *   - Facebook Pixel events at each stage
 *
 * Mobile-first: 16px inputs (prevents iOS zoom), 48px touch targets.
 */

